            <title>[IGNITE-4387] Incorrect Karaf OSGI feature for ignite-rest-http</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-4387</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;In accordance with the commit f177d4312c47 (&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-3277&quot; title=&quot;Migrate rest-http from outdated json-lib to Jackson&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;IGNITE-3277&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;IGNITE-3277&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt; Replaced outdated json-lib 2.4 to modern Jackson 2.7.5) dependencies in module ignite-rest-http have been updated. But Karaf OSGI features config has not been updated.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
